{"results":[{"url":"https://www.lexisnexis.com/en-us/products/lexis-plus-protege.page","final_url":"https://www.lexisnexis.com/en-us/products/lexis-plus-protege.page","title":"Lexis+ with Protégé | Legal AI Solution for Drafting & Research","description":"Lexis+ with Protégé is a legal AI solution for drafting, research, and analysis, delivering trusted results from authoritative LexisNexis resources.","language":"en","text":"# Lexis+ with Protégé: Legal AI software for drafting, research, and analysis\n\nLexis+® with Protégé™Legal AI, built on authority\n\nRequest a trial Explore what's new\n\n## What is Lexis+ with Protégé legal AI software?\n\nLexis+ with Protégé\\* is a legal AI solution for research, analysis, and drafting. It combines the power of the generative Protégé™ AI assistant with trusted LexisNexis content and built-in verification, so legal professionals can do their work from a single prompt box.  \n  \n*\\*Formerly Lexis+ AI*\n\n## New ways to bring legal work together\n\nSee what’s new\n\n## Legal AI Drafting\n\nLegal AI DraftingFull legal document drafting \n\nDraft and refine transactional agreements and contracts, as well as litigation motions, briefs, complaints, and client communications.\n\nStart draftingSee how it works\n\n## Legal AI Research\n\nConnect trusted sources, drive better results\n\nAccelerate research and surface insights with AI grounded in your organization’s knowledge, authoritative LexisNexis legal content, and web sources—so results are verified and traceable.\n\nStart researchingSee how it works\n\n## Legal AI tools to streamline legal work\n\nProductivity Features Streamline your work \n\nMove seamlessly from research and analysis to drafting and review in a connected AI-powered experience.\n\nStart streamliningSee how it works\n\n## Core Legal AI Features & Sources\n\nCore Features & Legal SourcesWhat powers Lexis+ with Protégé\n\nIntegrate advanced AI with authoritative, exclusive LexisNexis sources and your organization’s documents in one workspace.\n\n### Protégé\n\nLexisNexis Protégé is the AI assistant embedded across LexisNexis solutions — powering research, drafting, and analysis workflows.\n\nExplore Protégé\n\n### Primary law and exclusive secondary sources\n\nAccess one of the world's most comprehensive repositories of authoritative case law, statutes, regulations, and exclusive secondary sources.\n\n### Practical Guidance\n\nLeverage expert-authored practice notes, annotated forms, and drafting guidance across 25 practice areas.\n\n### *Shepard’s* citations\n\nValidate citations and confirm the status and treatment of authorities directly within your research and drafting workflow.\n\n### Web and news sources\n\nIncorporate real-time news and web content when timely context is required.\n\n### Your organization’s documents\n\nConnect to iManage, SharePoint, NetDocuments, and other DMS platforms to ask and draft from your organization’s knowledge.\n\nExplore integration\n\n### Secure document Vault\n\nSecurely store and analyze large document sets. Preserve context across sessions for drafting, review, and analysis.\n\n## Customer stories\n\nCustomer StoriesTrusted by leading legal teams\n\n### Amplifying talent and client relationships\n\nWatch the video\n\n### Why trusted data is critical for legal AI\n\nWatch the video\n\n## New Lexis+ with Protégé legal AI features\n\nRecently Announced in Lexis+ with ProtégéBring your legal work together, with verification built in\n\n### Verify legal authority as you work\n\n*Shepard’s* Verify checks citations in AI responses, documents, and drafts—surfacing legal authority and flagging unsupported statements.\n\nRead the post\n\n### Scale your expertise\n\nBuild reusable AI agent skills from your templates and processes, then share them across your organization. Browse a library of skills from LexisNexis and Claude to start from proven approaches.\n\nRead the post\n\n### Connect more LexisNexis content\n\nAccess insights from Lex Machina®, Intelligize®, CourtLink®, and Law360® within Lexis+ with Protégé. Connect your legal research with the analytics, filings, dockets, and news that help inform your work.\n\nExplore content options\n\n### Collaborate securely across legal teams\n\nKeep your team aligned in secure, shared Workrooms where AI work, documents, and discussions stay connected, with transparent permissions and activity history to reduce rework.\n\nRead the post\n\n### Work from the full record\n\nSave thousands of documents, spreadsheets, images, videos, and more in secure Vaults. Use them to support analysis, drafting, and review.\n\nRead the post\n\n## How legal professionals use legal AI in practice\n\nTutorialsHow legal professionals use Lexis+ with Protégé\n\nExplore how Protégé supports legal drafting, research, review, and preparation.\n\n1 min watch\n\n### Draft a transactional document\n\nTurn a term sheet into a customized agreement using pre-built workflows. Generate drafts grounded in trusted LexisNexis and organizational documents, then refine with integrated editing tools.\n\nTurn a term sheet into a customized agreement using pre-built workflows. Generate drafts grounded in trusted LexisNexis and organizational documents, then refine with integrated editing tools.\n\n1 min watch\n\n### Draft a litigation document\n\nGenerate a tailored complaint using pre-built workflows. Upload client materials, enter case-specific instructions, and produce a review-ready draft grounded in authoritative legal sources.\n\nGenerate a tailored complaint using pre-built workflows. Upload client materials, enter case-specific instructions, and produce a review-ready draft grounded in authoritative legal sources.\n\nWatch all tutorials\n\n## The Business Impact of Lexis+ with Protégé\n\nBusiness ImpactLexis+ with Protégé is transforming the business of law\n\n*Note: Lexis+ AI was renamed Lexis+ with Protégé in February 2026. Some materials may reference the former name.*\n\n### The Business Impact of Legal AI\n\nIndependent economic analysis quantifies the return on investment and operational gains for legal teams from generative artificial intelligence (genAI).\n\nRead the findings\n\n### Law Firms: 344% ROI over 3 years\n\nForrester Consulting conducted a Total Economic Impact™ study for large law firms, commissioned by LexisNexis in May 2025.\n\nRead the study\n\n### How Gibbons and Rupp Pfalzgraf are driving client impact with AI\n\nA strategic approach to legal AI has allowed these firms to increase caseload, focus on advanced analysis, and deliver exceptional value to clients.\n\nRead the case studies\n\n### Corporate Legal Departments: 284% ROI over 3 years\n\nForrester Consulting conducted a Total Economic Impact™ study for corporate legal departments, commissioned by LexisNexis in June 2025.\n\nRead the study\n\n### Schenck Price: The AI play helping a suburban firm hit harder\n\nSchenck Price made a deliberate bet that trusted data and disciplined adoption would help the firm compete smarter.\n\nRead the case study\n\n### Willkie: A more human-centered, grounded path to legal AI\n\nFor Willkie, adopting AI had to be practical, authoritative, and worthy of attorney trust.\n\nRead the story\n\n### Schenck Price: The AI play helping a suburban firm hit harder\n\nSchenck Price made a deliberate bet that trusted data and disciplined adoption would help the firm compete smarter.\n\nRead the case study\n\n### Willkie: A more human-centered, grounded path to legal AI\n\nFor Willkie, adopting AI had to be practical, authoritative, and worthy of attorney trust.\n\nRead the story\n\n## Data Security, Privacy, and Governance\n\nSecurity and privacy you can count on\n\n### Privacy by design\n\nLexisNexis protects customer data wherever it is stored, sent, or accessed. We apply privacy by design principles at every stage of our systems, products, and business processes to ensure security and compliance are built in from the start. Our advanced encryption and rigorous compliance protect your sensitive information.\n\n### Strict security protocols\n\nLexisNexis systems meet the highest standards for information security. We partner with trusted, enterprise-grade cloud providers, continuously monitor and improve our infrastructure, and undergo regular third-party audits to maintain industry-leading certifications.\n\n### Responsibly developed AI\n\nLexisNexis follows the RELX Responsible AI Framework to ensure our AI protects privacy, is transparent and explainable, avoids unfair bias, includes human oversight, and is designed for real-world impact.   \n  \nWe never use customer data to train AI models and maintain robust data retention and deletion policies. Identifiable information is removed from AI interactions so that we can improve performance without compromising privacy.\n\nExplore the LexisNexis Trust Center\n\n## Who is Lexis+ with Protégé for?\n\nLexis+ with Protégé helps legal professionals across the public, private, and academic sectors accelerate and enhance their work.  \n  \nDon’t see who you’re looking for? Contact us for a demo related to your unique needs.\n\n* Small law firms\n* Large law firms\n* Corporate legal departments\n* Government entities\n* Academic institutions\n\n## Awards and recognition\n\nLexisNexis is committed to innovation, leadership, and excellence in delivering cutting-edge technology.\n\n## FAQs about Lexis+ with Protégé\n\nFrequently asked questions\n\n### \n\nYes. As of February 2026, Lexis+ AI® has been renamed Lexis+® with Protégé™.  \n  \nThe platform has evolved to become a fully legal AI workflow solution for legal drafting, research, and analysis powered by the LexisNexis Protégé AI assistant. The new name reflects the expanded capabilities and deeper integration of AI-powered drafting, research, and analysis workflows.  \n  \nIf you previously used Lexis+ AI, you now have access to Lexis+ with Protégé.\n\n### \n\nLegal work requires authority and accountability. Lexis+ with Protégé is designed specifically for legal standards. You can trust legal work from Lexis+ with Protégé backed by:  \n\n* Responses based on the comprehensive LexisNexis collection of primary law, exclusive secondary sources, and Practical Guidance.\n* With Shepard’s Verify and Citation Service, citations can be verified for validation, status, and treatment, helping ensure authority and reliability.\n* More than 2,000 technologists, data scientists, and subject matter experts develop, fine-tune, and validate our AI solutions.\n* Responsibly developed AI with expert human oversight: AI development follows the RELX Responsible AI Principles, with human expertise embedded throughout design and improvement processes.\n\n  \nLexis+ with Protégé is advanced AI, specifically optimized for legal work.\n\n### \n\nLexis+ with Protégé is the legal drafting, research, and analysis AI solution. Protégé is the AI assistant built into that platform.   \n  \nLexis+ with Protégé is a comprehensive legal AI solution that combines:  \n\n* LexisNexis primary law, exclusive secondary sources, and Practical Guidance\n* Shepard’s citation validation\n* AI-powered drafting, research, summarization, and analysis skills and workflows\n\n  \nProtégé is the personalized generative and agentic AI assistant within Lexis+ with Protégé. It powers:  \n\n* Intelligent drafting and redlining\n* Conversational legal research\n* Document summarization\n* Analysis of uploaded materials\n* Workflow automation\n* Complex legal workflow management\n\n  \nProtégé adapts to user preferences and can securely leverage both LexisNexis sources and your organization’s documents to deliver grounded, citation-backed responses.  \n   \nAll Lexis+ with Protégé users benefit from seamless access to the Protégé AI assistant as part of the experience.\n\n### \n\nLexisNexis has always emphasized two critical AI development tenets:  \n\n* Users are in control of personalization\n* Data they share is not used to inform performance for other users\n\nLexis+ with Protégé is designed with robust privacy and security measures in place to protect sensitive client information and ensure compliance with relevant data protection regulations.   \n  \nUsers can review and manage their personalization settings at any time, allowing them to adjust the level of personalization or opt out entirely if desired. Data shared is not used to inform performance for other users.  \n  \nBy putting the user in control and providing transparency around data access and personalization settings, Lexis+ with Protégé aims to strike a balance between leveraging the power of AI personalization to enhance legal services and maintaining the highest standards of privacy, security, and user autonomy.  \n  \nFinally, LexisNexis has a comprehensive data protection program to safeguard customer information, including encryption, compliance with data protection laws, and regular security assessments and audits.\n\n### \n\nLexisNexis maintains strict data privacy and governance standards across all AI development.  \n\n* Customer data is not used to train public AI models.\n* Customer data is not used to enhance AI performance for other customers.\n* Personalization features are controlled by the user.\n* Personally identifiable information is protected in accordance with global data protection laws.\n\nLexisNexis has established privacy principles, governance structures, and compliance programs to ensure data privacy requirements are met across all jurisdictions where we operate.\n\n### \n\nUsers can upload a collection of securely-saved documents to a personal repository called a Vault. Protégé uses the documents stored in your Vault as the source for AI-powered tasks such as generating timelines, finding citations, analyzing counterarguments, or drafting documents. Protégé will also suggest tasks based on the documents uploaded to the Vault, further guiding your work.  \n\n* Create up to 50 Vaults with 1-500 documents per Vault. All data is securely stored and encrypted.\n* Uploading 11 or more documents automatically prompts you to create a Vault. Vaults are retained until you decide to delete them, and you can add/remove documents from your Vault at any time.\n* Uploads up to 10 documents, not saved to a Vault, are automatically purged at the end of each session.\n* Results from Protégé Vault are retained for 90 days under \"My Conversations\" history.\n\n### \n\nProtégé now offers a number of powerful configurations in Lexis+ with Protégé.  \n  \nProtégé Legal AI is optimized for legal accuracy and blends multiple LLMs from leading providers for the best legal use-case. The multi-model configuration grounds all responses in LexisNexis sources and includes Shepard’s citations.  \n  \nProtégé General AI includes access to large language models from OpenAI, Google, and Anthropic. Each model offers different reasoning strengths and writing styles, giving you the flexibility to explore, analyze, and communicate more effectively. New configurations are continuously assessed and added.\n\n### \n\nLexis+ with Protégé pricing varies based on factors such as the size of your organization, specific capabilities required, and the scope of content access. LexisNexis offers customized pricing tailored to individual needs.  \n  \nFor detailed pricing information, contact LexisNexis directly by submitting your information on this page or calling 1-888-AT-LEXIS. LexisNexis can provide a quote based on your specific requirements and offer guidance on the most suitable subscription plan for your practice.\n\n## Get your 2-day free trial\n\nSee how Lexis+ with Protégé helps you draft from precedent, validate citations, and accelerate research — grounded in trusted legal sources and your organization’s knowledge.\n\nLexisNexis, a division of RELX Inc., may contact you in your professional capacity with information about our other products, services, and events that we believe may be of interest. You can manage your communication preferences via our **Preference Center**. You can learn more about how we handle your personal data and your rights by reviewing our **Privacy Policy**.\n\n## Related solutions\n\n### Protégé\n\nLegal AI assistant, integrated in LexisNexis solutions.\n\n### Lexis Create+\n\nLegal drafting in Microsoft 365, powered by AI.\n\n### DMS integration\n\nSecure link to your document management system and LexisNexis.\n\n### Protégé API\n\nLexisNexis sources integrated into your internal systems.","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":875.16586700076,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}